{"id":"znakomyj","lemma":"знакомый","pos":"adj","rank":2651,"glosses":["familiar","acquainted (with)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6f/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D1%8B%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D1%8B%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"neuter":"знакомое","feminine":"знакомая","plural":"знакомые"},"examples":[{"text":"Что-то знакомое.","en":"That sounds familiar.","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"that"},null]},{"text":"Он не друг, а просто знакомый.","en":"He is not a friend, but an acquaintance.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"close friend"},{"g":"and / but"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},null]},{"text":"Там будет одна моя знакомая девушка.","en":"One girl I know will be there.","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null,{"g":"girl, lass"}]},{"text":"Том — старый знакомый семьи.","en":"Tom is an old acquaintance of the family.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"old"},null,{"g":"family","l":"семья"}]},{"text":"Приятно увидеть знакомое лицо.","en":"It's nice to see a familiar face.","words":[{"g":"pleasantly"},{"g":"to see"},null,{"g":"face"}]}]}